      "cooked": "<p>I was finally finishing some upacking from Gen con (long Story) and I came across my Rook City box that I bought at Gen Con. &nbsp;At the same time I picked up Rook City, I bought the core game, but it was out of stock and I paid and left my e-mail address, address, etc. &nbsp;Does anyone know what the status is of Gen Con orders? &nbsp;Its been about a month and I'm thinking that I should have heard something by now, but maybe not?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Thanks!</p>",
