      "created_at": "2012-09-21T14:29:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Endgame,</p><p>They are in the process of shipping GenCon orders now. The shipment was held up for a week in customs, after being held up in China by a typhoon. Kickstarter orders were sent out first as they ad priority and been waiting for longer, but the &gt;G guys should be shipping out everything in the next few* days</p><p>*=for a given value of few. There are quite a lot of orders to pack and ship</p>",
